# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/

# KCL
.kclvm/

# Crossplane / Upbound
.up/
_output/
*.xpkg

# env file
.env

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/

# Crossplane generated typed models (regenerated by `crossplane dependency add`
# / `update-cache`). Ignore the generated trees but keep the explanatory README.
schemas/*
!schemas/README.md

# Compiled embedded Crossplane function binaries built during
# testing/verification (e.g. `crossplane composition render`, `go build`).
# The output shares the module directory name and has no extension, so the
# generic patterns above do not catch it. Never commit these.
functions/*/compose-tenant-environment
functions/compose-tenant-environment/compose-tenant-environment
